  "sourceTitle": "Rustic Spice Rub",
  "sourceText": "Rustic Spice Rub\nBy: Sheri Wetherell\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 11:30am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 1/2 tablespoons Paprika\n1 tablespoon Cayenne\n1 tablespoon Fresh Ground Black pepper\n2 tablespoons Garlic Powder\n1 tablespoon Onion Powder\n2 tablespoons Salt\n1 tablespoon Dried Oregano\n2 tablespoons chili powder\n2 teaspoons ground cumin\n1 tablespoon ground coriander\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients and store in an air tight container\n\nAbout\n\n\nAn excellent rub for pork, beef and chicken!",
